### REGISTER POST 
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin123",
    "email": "admin@correo.com",
    "password": "admin123"
}

### LOGIN USER
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "janouser@correo.com",
    "password": "pass123"
}

### LOGOUT
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/logout


### PETICIONES DE PRODUCTO
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products

### POST CREAR PRODUCTO
POST http://localhost:3001/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Calceta Snoopy y sus amigos",
    "description": "Calceta muy divertida. Muy divertida para grandes y adultos.",
    "price": 4000,
    "stock": 15,
    "imageUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/df44tcwb2/image/upload/v1783296640/Designer_2_t7xmof.png"
}

### PUT Actualizar Producto
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/products/6a2cbbba4e2c4f5aca5a4c88
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "stock": 500
}

### GET Obtener un producto por ID
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products/6a2cbbba4e2c4f5aca5a4c88

### DELETE Eiminar un producto por su ID
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/products/6a2cbbba4e2c4f5aca5a4c88  

### ADD TO CART
POST http://localhost:3001/api/cart/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "6a222122bf34569eb9a5ef42",
    "productId": "6a2b6f5915c115c8efe7946d",
    "quantity": 2
}